Block chain database 
decentrilised database
build on top of mongo DB

features:
1. query API 
2. Immutability
3. Decentralization
4. Byzantine Fault Tolerant (BFT)
5. Low Latency
6. Public and Private servers 
7. Open sorces 
8. Traditional and BlockChain Stack


These assets can be registered on BigchainDB in two ways
1. By users in CREATE transactions
2. Transferred (or updated) to other users in TRANSFER transactions 
